<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Metro Kajang year net up 40 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Metro Kajang year net up 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   25.24     vs	18.02</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  28.57     vs	32.15</p>
<p>    Turnover		    200.66     vs     150.27</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     38.98     vs	28.33</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less   0.69     vs  less 0.97</p>
<p>    Extraordinaies		 -	 vs	 0.17</p>
<p>NOTE - Metro Kajang Holdings Bhd is involved in property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
